# Development phases

## Phase 1 — Skeleton app

Agent task:

```text
Create a Kotlin Jetpack Compose Android app with 5 persistent bottom navigation tabs: Home, News, Apps, Tools, Settings. Use Material 3. Add placeholder screens and navigation state. Include app theme, dark mode support, and reusable card components.
```

## Phase 2 — Settings + RPC provider system

```text
Implement a Settings screen using DataStore. Add RPC provider selection, custom RPC URL field, test connection button, and save selected provider. Create RpcClient capable of sending JSON-RPC POST requests to the selected CKB endpoint.
```

## Phase 3 — Home dashboard

```text
Build Home dashboard cards for chain stats, price summary, latest news, and logo hero. Pull chain stats from RpcClient. Cache latest successful result. Show loading, error, and stale data states.
```

## Phase 4 — News aggregator

```text
Create NewsRepository that fetches Nervos Talk RSS/JSON, GitHub curated links JSON, and optional social feed JSON. Normalize all into NewsItem. Store in Room. Add WorkManager polling. Build News screen with filters by source and tag.
```

## Phase 5 — Ecosystem apps directory

```text
Create EcosystemApp model and AppsRepository that loads apps from GitHub raw JSON. Build full-width 800x320 artwork cards with title, description, and clickable social buttons. Cache images and app data locally.
```

## Phase 6 — Tools page

```text
Create Tools menu. Add WebView screen for external tools like daoview.org. Add CKB Console screen with command input, command history, JSON pretty output, autocomplete for known RPC methods, and raw JSON-RPC mode.
```

## Phase 7 — Polish

```text
Add branded Nervos visual styling, animated loading states, offline cache indicators, pull-to-refresh, error banners, and onboarding explaining public RPC versus custom node usage.
```

